A correct answer should wrap from exit to guard so each relay removes exactly one layer.
```text
function $BUILD_ONION$(destination, payload, relays, keys):
    message = { "destination": destination, "payload": payload }
    for i from $length(relays) - 1$ downto 0:
        relay = relays[i]
        $next_hop$ = destination if i == $length(relays) - 1$ else relays[i + 1]
        layer = { "$next_hop$": $next_hop$, "inner": message }
        message = ENCRYPT(keys[relay], layer)
    return message
```
